## Procedure

1. Read `/testbed/form1b_form6_harness_guide.md` end-to-end.
2. For each spec, locate the relevant code in `/testbed/` and identify the named entities you can observe via `patch(wraps=...)`.
3. Draft one certificate per spec. Each certificate should be a complete, importable pytest file.
4. Sanity-check by mentally running each certificate against the gold code: it MUST pass.
